+    "caa9_key_findings_detailed": "Using ABRIM (N=260) we modeled ROI-level and thalamic subnuclei trajectories: R1 showed inverted-U with peaks ~50–65 years, while R2* and χ were largely linear. GPR z-scores showed strong interrelation between R2* and χ and weaker with R1. Applying ABRIM-derived models to PPP (controls N=44; PD N=316) reproduced higher R2* and χ in substantia nigra subregions in PD; more regions reached p<0.001 when increasing control sample size. Spatial gradients in putamen/caudate showed age-dependent patterns.",
